    <bpmn:process id="W_W4433" name="W4433. Self-Checkout &amp; Unattended Retail Strategy, Scope &amp; Operating Model" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Strategy review; wage/queue pressure; format evolution
Frequency: Annual + on strategic change
Volume: One enterprise SCO/scan-&amp;-go/unattended strategy across 200 stores
Owner: Head of Frontend/Store Ops (VS-07/VS-08) / Strategy (VS-33) / IT (VS-27)
Participants: Store Ops (VS-07), POS (VS-08), Strategy (VS-33), IT/EA (VS-27/VS-113), Loss Prevention (VS-23), Finance (VS-17.4), HR (VS-19/VS-103)
Source: workflow W4433 — Self-Checkout &amp; Unattended Retail Strategy, Scope &amp; Operating Model</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4433_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4433_Lane1" name="Strategy">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4433_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4433_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4433_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4433_Lane2" name="Finance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4433_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4433_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4433_Start4" name="Strategy review; wage/queue pressure; format evolution">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4433_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4433_Task5" name="Strategy/Frontend set the SCO/scan-&amp;-go strategy — objective (wage savings…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Strategy/Frontend set the SCO/scan-&amp;-go strategy — objective (wage savings, queue reduction, trade-pro experience), format mix (banked SCO, mobile scan-&amp;-go, locker/vending, unattended), phased rollout by store profile
Responsible (R): Strategy / Frontend / Store Ops
Accountable (A): COO / CIO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4433_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4433_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4433_Task6" name="Finance/LP model the business case — capex (VS-40), wage offset, expected SCO…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Finance/LP model the business case — capex (VS-40), wage offset, expected SCO loss-rate vs staffed, ROI/payback, and the loss-prevention investment to keep SCO shrink acceptable
Responsible (R): Finance / LP / Strategy
Accountable (A): CFO / COO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4433_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4433_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4433_Task7" name="Strategy/Frontend document the strategy, obtain approval, and cascade to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Strategy/Frontend document the strategy, obtain approval, and cascade to technology (W4434), layout (W4435), loss-prevention (W4437), change management (W4440)
Responsible (R): Strategy / Frontend
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4433_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4433_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4433_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4433_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4433_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-677 (ensure controlled execution — Self-Checkout &amp; Scan-&amp;-Go Strategy, Design &amp; Technology (PA-149.1).) | - CTL-677: strategy approved (COO/CIO/CFO); business case incl. loss-rate; format segmented by store profile; phased rollout
Owner: Head of Frontend/Store Ops (VS-07/VS-08) / Strategy (VS-33) / IT (VS-27)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4433_Assoc10" sourceRef="W4433_Annotation9" targetRef="W4433_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
