    <bpmn:process id="W_W4434" name="W4434. SCO/Scan-&amp;-Go Technology Selection &amp; Architecture" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Strategy (W4433); technology refresh
Frequency: Per selection + lifecycle
Volume: One SCO/scan-&amp;-go technology stack across 200 stores
Owner: IT (VS-27) / EA (VS-113) / Frontend (VS-08)
Participants: IT (VS-27), EA (VS-113), POS (VS-08), LP (VS-23), Security (VS-27.3), Vendor (VS-34), BI (VS-28)
Source: workflow W4434 — SCO/Scan-&amp;-Go Technology Selection &amp; Architecture</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4434_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4434_Lane1" name="IT">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4434_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4434_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4434_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4434_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4434_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4434_Start3" name="Strategy (W4433); technology refresh">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4434_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4434_Task4" name="IT/EA/Frontend select the SCO/scan-&amp;-go technology — SCO terminals, scan-&amp;-go…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: IT/EA/Frontend select the SCO/scan-&amp;-go technology — SCO terminals, scan-&amp;-go mobile app (links VS-75), computer-vision/just-walk-out, cash-recycler, weight-scale, integration to POS-ERP (VS-08) inventory/price/promo real-time
Responsible (R): IT / EA / Frontend
Accountable (A): CIO / COO
Duration: Per selection</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4434_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4434_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4434_Task5" name="IT/EA design the architecture — offline-capable (like POS ≥8hr), real-time sync…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: IT/EA design the architecture — offline-capable (like POS ≥8hr), real-time sync (&lt;30s), security (VS-27.3), integration to payment-gateway (VS-80), loyalty (VS-13), e-invoicing (BIR)
Responsible (R): IT / EA / Security
Accountable (A): CIO
Duration: Per lifecycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4434_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4434_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4434_Task6" name="IT/Vendor deploy, pilot, and validate transactional integrity (price/promo/tax)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: IT/Vendor deploy, pilot, and validate transactional integrity (price/promo/tax) vs staffed POS before scale
Responsible (R): IT / Vendor / POS / LP
Accountable (A): CIO / COO
Duration: Per rollout</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4434_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4434_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4434_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4434_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4434_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-677 (ensure controlled execution — Self-Checkout &amp; Scan-&amp;-Go Strategy, Design &amp; Technology (PA-149.1).) | - CTL-677: technology security-assessed (VS-27.3); integrated real-time to POS/payment/loyalty/e-invoicing; offline-capable; pilot-validated
Owner: IT (VS-27) / EA (VS-113) / Frontend (VS-08)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4434_Assoc9" sourceRef="W4434_Annotation8" targetRef="W4434_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
