    <bpmn:process id="W_W4435" name="W4435. SCO Lane Layout, Store Design &amp; Capacity Planning" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Strategy (W4433); new store (VS-37); remodel (VS-109)
Frequency: Per design/store
Volume: SCO lanes across 200 stores (profile-segmented count)
Owner: Frontend / Store Ops (VS-07) / Real Estate (VS-20/VS-109) / Visual Merch (VS-55)
Participants: Store Ops (VS-07), Real Estate (VS-20/VS-109), Visual Merch (VS-55), LP (VS-23), Customer Safety (VS-147), IFM (VS-138)
Source: workflow W4435 — SCO Lane Layout, Store Design &amp; Capacity Planning</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4435_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4435_Lane1" name="Frontend">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4435_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4435_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4435_Lane2" name="LP">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4435_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4435_Lane3" name="Store Ops">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4435_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4435_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4435_Start5" name="Strategy (W4433); new store (VS-37); remodel (VS-109)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4435_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4435_Task6" name="Frontend/Real Estate size SCO capacity per store profile (transaction volume…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Frontend/Real Estate size SCO capacity per store profile (transaction volume, peak queue, basket size, trade-pro vs DIY mix) and design the lane layout (banked SCO pod, attendant station, sight-lines, intervention queue)
Responsible (R): Frontend / Real Estate / Store Ops
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Per store</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4435_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4435_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4435_Task7" name="LP/Visual Merch design loss-prevention-into-layout (attendant sight-lines…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: LP/Visual Merch design loss-prevention-into-layout (attendant sight-lines, exit-control, mirror/camera coverage) and accessibility (wheelchair reach, screen, PWD lane) per BP 344 (links VS-147/W4454)
Responsible (R): LP / Visual Merch / Customer Safety
Accountable (A): LP Lead / VP Visual Merch
Duration: Per design</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4435_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4435_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4435_Task8" name="Store Ops/IFM implement (fixture, power/data, signage), validate capacity in…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Store Ops/IFM implement (fixture, power/data, signage), validate capacity in pilot, and adjust on throughput data (W4455)
Responsible (R): Store Ops / IFM / Frontend
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Per rollout</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4435_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4435_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4435_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4435_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
