        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-677 (ensure controlled execution — Self-Checkout &amp; Scan-&amp;-Go Strategy, Design &amp; Technology (PA-149.1).) | - CTL-677: capacity profile-sized; LP sight-lines in layout; BP 344 accessibility; throughput-validated (W4455)
