    <bpmn:process id="W_W4436" name="W4436. Assisted &amp; Mobile Scan-&amp;-Go (Bring-Your-Own-Device) Program Design" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Strategy (W4433); scan-&amp;-go rollout
Frequency: Per design + lifecycle
Volume: One scan-&amp;-go program (mobile app + device-supplied handheld)
Owner: Ecommerce/App (VS-75/VS-10) / Frontend (VS-08) / IT (VS-27)
Participants: App (VS-75), Ecommerce (VS-10), Frontend (VS-08), IT (VS-27), LP (VS-23), Loyalty (VS-13), Privacy (VS-91)
Source: workflow W4436 — Assisted &amp; Mobile Scan-&amp;-Go (Bring-Your-Own-Device) Program Design</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4436_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4436_Lane1" name="App">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4436_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4436_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4436_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
