      <bpmn:userTask id="W4436_Task5" name="App/Frontend design the scan-&amp;-go flow — BYOD (customer&#x27;s phone via app) and/or…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: App/Frontend design the scan-&amp;-go flow — BYOD (customer&#x27;s phone via app) and/or device-supplied handheld, scan→bag→pay→verify-exit, loyalty/price/promo real-time, payment (VS-80) integration
Responsible (R): App / Frontend / IT
Accountable (A): COO / CIO
