      <bpmn:userTask id="W4436_Task6" name="exit-verification">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: LP design the exit-verification control (random/AI-risk-based audit, weight/visual match) to deter scan-avoidance without fricting all customers, and privacy-by-design for app data (VS-91)
Responsible (R): LP / App / Privacy
Accountable (A): LP Lead / DPO
Duration: Per design</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4436_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4436_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
