      <bpmn:userTask id="W4437_Task4" name="LP/IT specify the weight-security design — bagging-area scale cross-check…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: LP/IT specify the weight-security design — bagging-area scale cross-check (expected vs actual weight per item), item-recognition camera, and intervention-prompt on mismatch (the core SCO anti-scan-avoidance control)
Responsible (R): LP / IT / Frontend
Accountable (A): LP Lead / CIO
Duration: Per design</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4437_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4437_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4437_Task5" name="LP/IT layer computer-vision/analytics — SKU-recognition (e.g. produce/bulk)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: LP/IT layer computer-vision/analytics — SKU-recognition (e.g. produce/bulk), barcode-swap detection (cheap barcode on expensive item), &quot;sweethearting&quot; (attendant override pattern), and exception-casework (W4450)
Responsible (R): LP / IT / BI
Accountable (A): LP Lead
Duration: Per design + tuning</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4437_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4437_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4437_Task6" name="LP/Frontend tune thresholds (false-positive vs detection), train attendants on…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: LP/Frontend tune thresholds (false-positive vs detection), train attendants on intervention protocol, and review loss data (W4455) to iterate
Responsible (R): LP / Frontend
Accountable (A): LP Lead / COO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4437_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4437_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
