Frequency: Per design + on regulation change
Volume: Age-restricted (cutting tools, solvents) + DG/hazmat + catch-weight items in SCO
Owner: Frontend (VS-08) / Compliance (VS-22) / DG (VS-114)
Participants: Frontend (VS-08), Compliance (VS-22), DG (VS-114), LP (VS-23), HSE (VS-24), Store Ops (VS-07), IT (VS-27)
Source: workflow W4438 — Age-Restricted, Hazmat &amp; Controlled-Item Intervention Design</bpmn:documentation>
