      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4439_Task8" name="Legal/Compliance confirm regulatory fit (LGU permit for 24-hr/unattended, BIR…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Legal/Compliance confirm regulatory fit (LGU permit for 24-hr/unattended, BIR CAS/e-invoicing, age-restricted sale rules) and pilot before scale
Responsible (R): Legal / Compliance / Strategy
Accountable (A): VP Legal / COO
Duration: Per pilot</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4439_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4439_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4439_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4439_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4439_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-677 (ensure controlled execution — Self-Checkout &amp; Scan-&amp;-Go Strategy, Design &amp; Technology (PA-149.1).) | - CTL-677: access-controlled; CCTV/fire/life-safety; emergency comms; regulatory-permit confirmed; pilot-validated
Owner: Strategy (VS-33) / Store Ops (VS-07) / IT (VS-27)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
